# LanceDB local mode

This directory is the local fallback for CocoIndex's `LANCE_DB`
connection (see `cocoindex_flows/_shared/_lifespan.py:59`). When
`EMBED_BACKEND=sentence_transformers` (the offline dev default —
see Makefile target `cocoindex-update`), the CocoIndex Apps write
their tables to `./data/lancedb/<project>.lance/`.

The `.lance/` directories are gitignored (per `.gitignore:107-117`).
Only this `.gitkeep` is tracked.
